  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support and strengthening of civil society organizations in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fund to support civil society organizations in Colombia that are working to promote peace, humar rights and environmental rights in Colombia. This is aimed at contributing to implementation of the peace agreement in Colombia, including a strong focus on gender through activities based on UN resolution 1325.</narrative>
  </description>
